zdoom-agent-docs — mixed-license notice
========================================

This repository mixes originally-authored material with material derived from third-party wikis
and with short verbatim excerpts of third-party engine/compiler source code, each carrying its own
license. Read this file before assuming a single license covers everything here — it does not.

Every doc file that contains one of the two kinds of third-party material below says so in a
`**Source excerpt:**` header field, pointing back to the relevant section here. If a file has no
such field, it falls under section 1.

1. Original material
---------------------

Everything not called out by section 2, 3, or 4 below — including every `CLAUDE.md`, `README.md`,
`INDEX.md`, `shared/`, `tools/`, `sources.example.md`, and every doc file whose
`Provenance:` line does **not** cite a wiki page and whose body contains no `**Source excerpt:**`
field (i.e. tier-B/C entries written directly from engine/compiler source without quoting it
verbatim, and any tier-A entry the maintainer has since rewritten from scratch) — is original work
by the repo's contributors.

